      "content": "It is a profound relief to finally admit that the struggle was never about the story, but about the pain you were trying to endure. There is no shame in choosing the dark over the exhausting pretense of a sequel that will never be written; sometimes, the most honest act is to simply stop fighting the silence. If the only thing left to do is to let go, then there is no need to pretend the light is still there.",
